{
  "_README": [
    "Event weapons that monsterhunternow.com does not publish. The source has NO",
    "event weapons at all, so these can never arrive via build.js — they live here",
    "and are merged in on every build, which is why they survive a rebuild.",
    "",
    "Only supply what you actually know. A weapon with just its 10-5 state gets one",
    "grade entry at grade 10 with a single level 5 row; it will then appear in",
    "v_weapon_10_5 and the picker, and correctly NOT appear in v_weapon_8_2.",
    "",
    "Ids: series ids from 9000 and game_weapon_id from 900000 are reserved for",
    "manual rows. build.js fails loudly if one ever collides with a real game id.",
    "",
    "recoil/reload use the game's enum vocabulary so they match the rows that",
    "come from the source. The in-game wording maps as follows — derived by",
    "matching 192 ammo entries in MHN.xlsx against the same entries in the",
    "source, so this is measured rather than guessed:",
    "  recoil  Low=SMALL  Average=MEDIUM  High=LARGE *or* LARGE_2  Very high=EXTRA_LARGE  Wyvern=WYVERN",
    "  reload  Fast=SMALL Normal=MEDIUM   Slow=LARGE *or* LARGE_2   Very slow=EXTRA_LARGE",
    "",
    "NOTE the game collapses LARGE and LARGE_2 into one label for both stats, so",
    "an in-game reading of 'High recoil' or 'Slow reload' cannot tell you which",
    "of the two it is. Rose Assault's entries below pick LARGE; if it turns out",
    "to be LARGE_2 the only thing that changes is the displayed wording.",
    "",
    "skills[] holds event skills the source does not publish either. They are",
    "merged BEFORE the weapons, so an event weapon can reference one. Ids from",
    "9100 are reserved for them; real skill ids currently reach 221."
  ],
